<!--
  A stipulation, not a filing. See assets/fixtures/README.md. Nothing here was observed, and
  nothing here may be cited as evidence about any business.

  The state this exists for is a loop in the graph of units. A conversion runs from a part
  layer's unit to the composed layer's unit and carries `asrt:Part/factor`, so every fusion
  that converts links two units, and the documents together make a graph of them.
  `merge-holding-composition` files one link, GPU to GPU-hour at 672, 720 or 744. This file
  files two more, and they close a loop:

      GPU        to  GPU-hour    at 672, 720 or 744
      GPU-hour   to  node-hour   at 0.125
      node-hour  to  GPU         at 0.0108, 0.0112 or 0.0116

  The loop is in the units, never in the parts. Parts never loop back, and two rules,
  `layers_move_together` and `jagged_layer`, keep them that way. The three layers below form a
  chain, reserved-hours then node-capacity then cards, and nothing is composed from itself; it
  is the units that come back round.

  What the loop is worth, and it is not an equality. The three factors multiplied give 0.9072
  at the low end, 1.008 at the most likely value and 1.0788 at the high end. One lies inside,
  and the product is not one, nor can it be: through a month of 720 hours, factors written as
  decimals never bring the loop back to exactly one. The rule a receiver can hold it to is
  containment: one lies inside the product's range.

  The width is not measurement error. The month that turns cards into card-hours is the same
  month that turns node-hours back into cards; multiplying the ranges treats them as two
  independent months, where a receiver who knew they were one month would get one. It is the
  third place in this repository where treating quantities that move together as independent
  widens a range past what the filer knows: see the shares of `merge-holding-composition`'s
  `compute`, and the composed remainder beside them.

  The two kinds of exactness are filed side by side on purpose. Eight cards to a chassis can be
  counted, so that factor is a single value. A month is not one number, so the other has a
  range, for the reason merge-holding-composition gives about its own.
-->
